.SH ATTESTATION
The internal provider verifies signatures on packed and FIDO U2F registration
responses using the supplied public key or attestation certificate.
It also accepts the unsigned "none" attestation format, as OpenSSH does.
Certificate chains, certificate lifetime and vendor trust are not checked.
Attestation export with write-attestation is unsupported.
